    a: 'Yes. The Junk, originally named June Hong Chian Lee, appeared in the James Bond film The Man with the Golden Gun and in Swiss Family Robinson. Built in Penang, Malaysia, in 1962, she first worked as a coal transport boat before being converted into a diving liveaboard in Thailand after 1997.'
